{
  "about": "SHARING_40.md 19.2: device_model as each SDK makes it. Android passes Build.MANUFACTURER and Build.MODEL; iOS the hardware identifier (sysctl hw.machine, on a simulator SIMULATOR_MODEL_IDENTIFIER); macOS sysctl hw.model. Web, Windows and Linux send no device_model. null: the body leaves the field out. Every non-null output matches the server's pattern ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9 _.,+()/-]{0,63}$.",
